    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ROBERTA: I wonder what she'll say when she sees this...\nLESLIE: Oh, are you on that again? It's ridiculous.\nROBERTA: — You never know... That's my philosophy.",
      "ROBERTA: I can't think of anything.\nLESLIE: Give her a chance.\nROBERTA: I'm trying.",
      "ALVINA: Gorgeous, isn't it? All hand embroidered. Want to try it on?\nROBERTA: It would never fit me.\nALVINA: Yes it will, just try it.\nALVINA: I'll put your sweater in a bag...",
      "ROBERTA: What should I do?\nAMY: Learn to concentrate. Control your fantasies.\nAMY: Trust yourself. Be courageous.",
      "AMY: c= Don't worry about your memory. Think about your fate.\nROBERTA: I will."
    ]
